    "MAKO is a 1.4 m torpedo-shaped AUV with X-configured fins and three thrusters (one axial, two vertical). It carries an IMU, a DVL, a depth sensor, a pair of Cerulean Omniscan 450 SS side-scan sonars and a monocular camera in the nose. It has two jobs: survey the seabed with side-scan sonar, and come home on its own into a funnel dock marked by four lights.",
