     "id": "hydrodynamics",
     "title": "The simulator replica",
     "paragraphs": [
      "When the controllers misbehaved in the lab simulator, I ran its own code offline with the MAKO vessel file and found eight causes. They included thrust that could not reverse from rest, fin lift multiplied twice by the sign of the angle of attack, stale fin coefficients, added mass never entering the dynamics, fins placed with no moment arm, and very slow actuators. I wrote a patch for each and tuned the gains on the repaired replica."
     ]
