   "category": "Research",
   "tagline": "Teaching an underactuated AUV to find an unknown dock with sonar, then dock using its camera.",
   "org": "MAVLAB, IIT Madras · with V. Deogaonkar and Prof. A. Somayajula",
   "role": "Lead author (abstract, UT27)",
